clause_text:
Section 6.02 Indebtedness. The Borrower and Guarantors will not incur, create,
assume or permit to exist any indebtedness or liability on account of deposits
or advances or any indebtedness for borrowed money, or any other indebtedness
or liability evidenced by notes, bonds, debentures or similar obligations,
except:

(a) indebtedness evidenced by the Note;

(b) Trade credit and short term leases;

(c) Capital leases;
